description: |
    The new ``jira`` exporter creates and updates Jira Cloud issues from resolved
    tmt metadata. Configure the project, issue type, UUID field, automation URL,
    title, optional workflow status and relationship mappings through CLI options
    or ``/export/jira`` in the tmt configuration tree. Typed additional field
    mappings and public enrichment/action hooks support site-specific integrations.
    Layer shareable YAML profiles with ``--jira-profile`` and select ordinary field
    ownership with ``managed-fields``. Credentials can come from environment variables
    or existing Jira connection settings. The exporter prepares and validates the whole
    collection before writes; dry-run output displays planned fields and operations.

    Use ``--create`` to allow creation and ``--dry`` to preview without writes.
    Metadata backlinks require ``--link-jira``. See :ref:`jira-project-configuration`
    for authentication, schema requirements, field ownership and extension examples.
